   "beat_id": "B02",
   "act": "OFF KEY",
   "narration_text": "A semitone, one step on a piano, is a hundred cents. My synthetic singer, singing a short tune in C major, was off by about twenty-nine cents on average: never a wrong note, just a little sharp or flat.",
